WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open a checklist’s Plans stage and choose OpStack intelligence plan.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Step 2: Describe the plan, such as “repeat hourly from opening until closing”. Each checklist has one planner.

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:22.458
Step 3: Review the start date, recurrence and timing, then choose Apply paused plan. This creates the first planner or updates the existing one in place, paused for review.

4
00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:31.458
Step 4: Check Locations, Assignees and saved trading hours, then activate the planner when ready. Existing locations and assignees are retained when intelligence updates its settings.
